"P1614736247" "Bring in the Arachnos traitor (Optional)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P428970474" "Let's proceed with this."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1284903051" "Looks like you and I are in for a fight."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2553205800" "One of the runes have been activated!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1258452660" "Another rune is active!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1457709806" "The ritual is ready, we need to move!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2084183109" "Is this the best way to recover the Isles?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2041638616" "{HeroName}! Don't you give up?!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3475429766" "<em>This is the fastest way. We kill two birds with one stone by doing this."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3520570664" "You can't get by us, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1636381709" "We need to track down Vincent. He needs to understand the condition he's in."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1647576271" "I should've known you'd show up here, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3594137651" "<em>How can you still believe that? He's a victim of his own undoing. It isn't because of what the Coralax did to him."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3272767784" "What about Vincent? Are we just going to leave him when we begin to cleanse Sharkhead?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P63491956" "You're working with Vincent, aren't you {HeroName}? You're just as delusional as he is!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3414842597" "<em>We'll recover him and try to reverse what was done to him. If we're able to locate him."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P170189574" "Arcanist Millian"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3145517315" "Perfect, we've been looking for this Coralax cavern for some time. We'll have all the shards in place to make our next move."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1941616217" "{HeroName}! You and your kind will have no place in this world when we're done!"

