// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1936714319" "<shout>Stop {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P770228205" "<shout>Find Ross! He's helping {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P68370115" "<shout>You can't have the power of the Leviathan!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3237046984" "<shout>We will use the power of the Leviathan for good, unlike you!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4151256910" "<shout>You have no place in this world, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2442574539" "<shout>Your evil ways will end today!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3863798205" "<shout>Keep moving, we need to recover the Blood Coral!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2150762162" "<shout>We can't lose that Blood Coral, not to {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
