// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2501674275" "It doesn't seem like Kadabra Kill was too thrilled about your actions."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3929663661" "You've recovered the ritual to protect yourself from the Leviathan's power!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4088009974" "You have delt with Botis? And found the ritual? {HeroName}, I almost believe that this is too good to be true! Truly, you were the right person to work together with. Soon, your power shall be realized, and I shall have my vengeance against the Legacy Chain! <br><br>I must apologize, {HeroName}, for my... lack of faith in your abilities. I have been betrayed and let down by all those who I have trusted. Perhaps... you are someone who I can truly depend on. Maybe you are simply using me for your own ends... maybe. But if so, at least you have not yet discarded me, and I plan to make sure you have no reason to.<br><br>I shall enact the ritual from here when you enter the Leviathan in order to keep your mind from being destroyed. However, I must warn you... time is running out."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Lorenz 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P615227217" "So, you got Alexander, huh? Good riddance. He got his head too far up in the clouds. You say he was tryin' to say somethin' about me? Whatever, I ain't got time to be bothered with whatever idealistic thing he was thinkin'.<br><br>You done good for the Family, {HeroName}. This ain't something that we're gonna forget, not for a long time. The payment for all ya help is on the way now. You got anythin' else?"
// Answer Text :
"P2897426457" "I could actually use the Family's help with an operation."
// Page HaveLorenz Text :
"P2020610153" "Eh?<br><br>Huh. Well. That's gonna be a tough one, {HeroName}. Lotta our boys are out and about right now, so it's gonna be tough for me to get 'em to come help.<br><br><color orange>Lorenz looks around, then grins.</color><br><br>Tell ya what, {HeroName}. You let me know the place to be, and I'll show up there myself to give ya hand. I figure you and me are close now seein' as how you killed my brother and all."
// Answer Text :
"P965054737" "Er... right. We're real close."
// Page DontHave Text :
"P2043271509" "Eh?<br><br>Huh. Well. That's gonna be a tough one, {HeroName}. Lotta our boys are out and about right now, so it's gonna be tough for me to get 'em to come help.<br><br><color orange>Lorenz looks around, then grins.</color><br><br>Tell ya what, {HeroName}. You let me know the place to be, and I'll show up there myself to give ya hand. I figure you and me are close now seein' as how you killed my brother and all. Speakin' of close, I've been thinkin'. You and me, we should work together when this whole thing is over. Gimme a call and we'll work something out.<br><br><color orange>Lorenz Ansaldo has been added as a contact!</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Vince 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P2737558708" "{HeroName}! Were you able to get that artifact powered up or what?<br><br><color orange>You could lie to Vince and say the artifact is much more powerful than it really is, or say that you didn't find anything and keep it for yourself..."
// Answer Text :
"P2384870917" "Here it is, it can detect chunks of red coral on Sharkhead."
// Answer Text :
"P2358215302" "It's just a useless amulet. Sorry, Vince."
// Page HaveVince Text :
"P2475907383" "Hah, brilliant work {HeroName}! Mr. Cage'll have your payment set up right away. It was good doin' business with ya.<br><br><color orange>You mention to Vince Dubrowski that you could use the help of the Cage Consortium in foiling the last plan of the Legacy Chain.</color><br><br>Huh. Well, Mr. Cage has got his men workin' overtime on cracking down on those Scrapyarders. But for you, {HeroName}, Vince Dubrowski is gonna make an exception. I'll come down and help you out myself, since you've done a lot to help out the Consortium. You give me a ring on where I got to be and I'll be down there to give you a hand."
// Page DontHaveVince Text :
"P1325279982" "Hah, brilliant work {HeroName}! Mr. Cage'll have your payment set up right away. It was good doin' business with ya.<br><br><color orange>You mention to Vince Dubrowski that you could use the help of the Cage Consortium in foiling the last plan of the Legacy Chain.</color><br><br>Huh. Well, Mr. Cage has got his men workin' overtime on cracking down on those Scrapyarders. But for you, {HeroName}, Vince Dubrowski is gonna make an exception. I'll come down and help you out myself, since you've done a lot to help out the Consortium. You give me a ring on where I got to be and I'll be down there to give you a hand.<br><br>Speaking of which, Mr. Cage is real happy about all the work you've done for us and was hoping you might help me out with some more issues we're having. When this is all over, come talk to me and we'll work some things out.<br><br><color orange>You've gained Vince Dubrowsk as a contact!</color>"
// Page OtherHaveVince Text :
"P1459522651" "Huh, that's too bad for us. Funny for those Scrapyarders though, those Legacy Chain goons are smarter than I would've thought if they were just using those Scrapyarders liker that.<br><br><color orange>You mention to Vince Dubrowski that you could use the help of the Cage Consortium in foiling the last plan of the Legacy Chain.</color><br><br>Huh. Well, Mr. Cage has got his men workin' overtime on cracking down on those Scrapyarders. But for you, {HeroName}, Vince Dubrowski is gonna make an exception. I'll come down and help you out myself, since you've done a lot to help out the Consortium. You give me a ring on where I got to be and I'll be down there to give you a hand."
// Page OtherDontHaveVince Text :
"P331370107" "Huh, that's too bad for us. Funny for those Scrapyarders though, those Legacy Chain goons are smarter than I would've thought if they were just using those Scrapyarders liker that.<br><br><color orange>You mention to Vince Dubrowski that you could use the help of the Cage Consortium in foiling the last plan of the Legacy Chain.</color><br><br>Huh. Well, Mr. Cage has got his men workin' overtime on cracking down on those Scrapyarders. But for you, {HeroName}, Vince Dubrowski is gonna make an exception. I'll come down and help you out myself, since you've done a lot to help out the Consortium. You give me a ring on where I got to be and I'll be down there to give you a hand.<br><br>Speaking of which, Mr. Cage is real happy about all the work you've done for us and was hoping you might help me out with some more issues we're having. When this is all over, come talk to me and we'll work some things out.<br><br><color orange>You've gained Vince Dubrowsk as a contact!</color>""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Maros 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P2942240320" "So, {HeroName}. You have uncovered the beginning of an entity more ancient than anyone could dream of.<br><br>Impressive, is it not? There are many paths for you to go from now. Many of them revolve around you and this entity. Well, there are <i>other</i> paths, but those involve your untimely demise. Hopefully those paths are not the ones you will go down, but one will never know.<br><br>I see you plan on meeting the entity of this Leviathan face to... somewhat face soon. However, as you know, there are other forces out there that would seek to thwart your efforts. I believe it is time for me to make a move I have not made in many years."
// Answer Text :
"P712521273" "What is that?"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P1997625818" "To intervene directly in events. I shall personally move to help you strike against these forces. Perhaps I am also interested in seeing, for myself, which path this entity will take.<br><br>Contact me within the warehouse and I shall appear to aid you in the events to come."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Leonard 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P3545569013" "{HeroName}. I realize every time we have spoke that I've gone on about various parts of my past. I shall not do that this time, for I know there is little time left."
// Answer Text :
"P1763698190" "Good. I will contact you when things are ready."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P4055941606" "Excellent. I will prepare myself, as I do understand this is the pinnacle of your work. I will ensure that your plan does not fail, not when we've come this far."
// Answer Text :
"P832080024" "Very good, Leonard."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - OptionalContacts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Vince Text :
"P505163034" "<color orange>You contact Vince Dubrowski to let him know where you are.</color>"
// Page Lorenz Text :
"P3661759317" "<color orange>You contact Lorenz Ansaldo to let him know where you are.</color>"
// Page Maros Text :
"P3098610551" "<color orange>You contact Diviner Maros to let him know where you are.</color>"
// Page Leonard Text :
"P4144598117" "<color orange>You contact Leonard to let him know where you are.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1453272436" "The protections on our Blood Coral crystal are fading, {HeroName}. And, unfortunately for us, the Legacy Chain are aware of where we're keeping it now. We don't have a lot of time left! We've come too far now to lose because of this. I will begin the ritual on my end to enable you to use the crystal to enter the Leviathan. In the meantime, I need you to guard the crystal from those <i>backstabbers</i> in the Legacy Chain!<br><br>Once my magic is finished, you can enter and speak with the Leviathan, though I would be very careful, {HeroName}. The ritual that I have here will protect you from being absorbed by the Leviathan, but if the creature were to awaken... well, then we may all be dead. None of us would have control over it, and it would be able to destroy anything in its path.<br><br><color orange>All you need from this beast is the knowledge of power that it holds. If the fully formed Blood Coral crystal is causing the Leviathan to awaken, then destroying it once you're done should prevent the beast from destroying you and everything else in Sharkhead - you'll just have to make sure to take a small piece of the Blood Coral for your future use.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1197324130" "When I'm finished, I'll blow up the Blood Coral. I'll already have what I need."
// SendOffString :
"P1278752459" "Hrm, well, yes, I suppose that's the best thing. Having the Blood Coral around will risk others finding out what you know. Perhaps... <i>perhaps</i> the information you learn will enable you to use whatever is left of the Blood Coral after to empower yourself. I would be <i>very</i> interested to see what is possible with that...<br><br>But we can save that for later. If I'm correct, the Legacy Chain may already be on their way to the storage facility. Hurry, and I will do what I can from here!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2675230582" "Learn the Source of True Power"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3672433128" "I can't be distracted, {HeroName}, I must focus on this task!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3649404191" "<color deepskyblue>Part Five: The Key to Power</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4172938674" "You can hear some Legacy Chain up ahead. You're too close to learning the Leviathan's power now to let them stop you!"
// ExitStringSuccess :
"P3191715570" "You leap out from the warehouse before it explodes, destroying all the re-activated Blood Coral. Well, all of it except for one last piece that you recovered."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3753684195" "30 seconds to destroy the Longbow communicator to prevent reinforcements"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P53485338" "2 minutes for Vincent's ritual to complete"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P13773578" "Secure the area against incoming heroes"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P864464278" "Enter the Blood Coral Crystal"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3383608100" "Nothing"
// Script Variable HERO_NAME :
"P2051293136" "Diviner Maros"
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2127861816" "I have arrived. Let us proceed, {HeroName}, so that you shall see the events that will transpire."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4108618126" "Let us see if these Legacy Chain will follow what I have seen."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P898406489" "It is time for us to enter the crystal and to face the power that commands the Leviathan."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1651269388" "The inside of the Leviathan... it is more wonderous than my visions could have prepared me for..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4292440685" "This is the test for knowledge. We have seen this is common. Let us prove to this entity that we can obtain this forbidden knowledge."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2324266895" "The branches collapse, and you arrive to the point where I originally saw you. You know now, the destiny of Merulina and her destruction. As do I."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P138320667" "The slumbering beast begins to awaken. The entirety of the Isles is at stake, with your very life at the center. This path is the one that I thought would never happen..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1338205306" "The beast has been tamed. It is time for us to go, while there is still a moment to spare."
// Script Variable HERO_NAME :
"P1958552599" "Vince Dubrowski"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3436073768" "I'm going to enjoy pounding in these Legacy Chain, they got it coming to 'em!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2319096002" "So are we going to go into this freaky crystal now? Alright, I guess."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P419007067" "Gotta tell ya, {HeroName}, this sure is the craziest thing I've seen in a while."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1116969758" "Who's this guy telling us what to do?! You ain't Mr. Cage, what do you know!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2130535759" "The hell is this Merulina lady?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1365914211" "This is bad! We can't let Sharkhead go down! Mr. Cage is going to be furious if that happens!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2212465927" "We gotta get ourselves outta here!"
// Script Variable HERO_NAME :
"P1014222212" "Lorenz Ansaldo"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3176431144" "You might wanna stand back, 'cause I'm gonna let loose some aggression on these magic freaks."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4020336862" "We done here? 'Cause it looks like that crystal thing of yours is wantin' us to go inside of it."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2559942474" "I ain't sayin' this much, but this thing is the weirdest thing I've seen in my entire life."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P295880010" "You got yourself into somethin' real serious, you coulda warned me we'd be dealin' with mytholigically inclined creatures here!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4106454181" "What kinda freakin' memories are these things?!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P633709073" "You think you're gonna destroy Sharkhead?! I grew up in this here place, you ain't destroyin' my home!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2018861823" "I wanna go on record as sayin' we should get the hell outta here!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3793537492" "I'm prepared use all my effort to repel these Legacy Chain."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4191377878" "I believe it's time to enter this forbidden crystal."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2081323624" "Ah... I've seen many things, but I believe this is the most fantastical thing yet..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1626582541" "This creature should know better than to test us."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1069091873" "Memories of the past... of a goddess... amazing..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1729195858" "I believe this may be an issue...!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3682517662" "The ritual is done! We should get out of here!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P885976412" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>You've done an excellent job in making it here, {HeroName}. <t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>You already are fully aware that I am the being behind Leviathan, are you not? <t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>You have come very far, farther than most have ever dared to travel. <t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Let us see what you think when you learn the nature of all things. Find the answers you seek within this creature's stems."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P485992391" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>You see now, {HeroName}, the nature of those who wield great power, such as Merulina. <t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Power is never destroyed, simply transferred. This Leviathan brims with the power of that ancient goddess. <t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>When the Leviathan awakens, so too will the Blood Coral receive part of Merulina's ancient power. <t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>You are fairly powerful, {HeroName}. Perhaps, one day, you would have inherited power even greater than Merulina's.. <t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>But now, it is time for the great beast to awaken. It will either destroy all, or encounter the one who will inherit Merulina's power. <t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>And you, {HeroName}, will be the first to be devoured by the power of the Leviathan. Goodbye."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3328323438" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Black>This is Vincent, {HeroName}! I'm starting the ritual now, you need to hurry! The entirety of Sharkhead is shaking madly! <t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Black>The Leviathan... it's starting to come to life!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P952729841" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Impressive, {HeroName}. It seems you may be one of the few who will truly rise to greatness, beyond the cowardice of Lord Recluse. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>I look forward to what you shall do with just a fraction of Merulina's power transferred to you through the activated Blood Coral, but know that its power will only last for a small amount of time."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P724056309" "<shout>We must stop {HeroName} before it is too late!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P520788170" "<shout>Get everyone in here, we've got a code red situation, surround the building!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3351210945" "<shout>Longbow will not allow this to continue!"

